{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "Here is my formal disclosure for the record. Last night, the university supplied the controlling schedule to their master research agreement. Upon review, I confirmed that background patents U1, U2, and U3 are licensed to the company only for noncommercial academic use. This directly conflicts with the current draft, which grants the university partner an exclusive commercial license to all background technology used in the project. The final agreement must exclude those three patents from any commercial license and require separate written university consent before any commercial use of those patents. I have not yet incorporated this finding into the draft or circulated it, as the schedule was only supplied overnight."}
```

